# Force LF line endings for all text files in the repository, on every
# platform and every checkout. Without this, a Windows contributor with
# core.autocrlf=true (or any CI runner that normalizes line endings) can end
# up with CRLF-terminated working-tree files even though the committed blob
# is LF-only. That silently breaks byte-for-byte generated-artifact checks
# such as `npm run openapi:check`, and corrupts the shebang line of shell
# scripts like `mvnw` when they are COPYed into a Linux Docker build stage
# straight from a Windows working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
